    <!--
      Bokeya brand mark.

      Concept: the Bengali letter ব drawn as a single ledger entry. The matra and stem are the
      record; the bowl is split into two strokes - the upper one leaving the stem (আমি দেব) and
      the lower one curling back into it (আমি পাব) - so the letterform itself describes money
      going out and coming back. The dot where they almost meet is the balance point.
    -->
